@startuml prompt-assembly
' ============================================================================
'  build_system_prompt — the exact section order (infrastructure/prompt.py).
'  Highlights the Tier-0 behavioral work: persona (SOUL.md), self-knowledge,
'  honesty-by-default + verify gate.  Render: java -jar ../../../plantuml.jar -tpng prompt-assembly.puml
' ============================================================================
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam nodesep 8
skinparam ranksep 18
skinparam ArrowColor #888888
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #888888
  roundCorner 8
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #999999
  FontStyle bold
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFF8DC
  BorderColor #C9B458
}

title build_system_prompt — section order (top = highest priority)\namber = new (Tier 0 behavioral)    blue = mode-conditional    green = pre-existing

package "Base prompt (every agent + plain chat)" #F2F2F2 {
  rectangle "1.  Identity\n'You are <name>… model identity'" as I #C8E6C9
  rectangle "1a'. PERSONA  [S1 / S0.5]\nresourceful-then-ask-ONE-Q · propose+confirm on\nbig/irreversible · NEVER fabricate (done=evidence)\n· trust(bold-reversible/careful-external)\nLOADED FROM editable SOUL.md (persona_file),\nconstant fallback · persona_enabled" as P #FFE9C7
  rectangle "1a. Agent IDENTITY.md\n(per-agent bootstrap — can refine persona)" as ID #C8E6C9
  rectangle "1b. HEARTBEAT.md   (heartbeat mode only)" as HB #DAE8FC
  rectangle "1b'. Scheduled-run note + report_outcome   (cron mode only)" as CR #DAE8FC
  rectangle "1b''. Channel reply note   (channel mode only)" as CH #DAE8FC
  rectangle "1c. Language" as L #C8E6C9
  rectangle "2.  Tooling  (one line per available tool)" as T #C8E6C9
  rectangle "2a'. ## What you are  [S2]\nDYNAMIC from organs present: schedule(cron) ·\nwake(heartbeat) · reach-user(notify) · be-reached\n(channels) · remember(memory) · delegate(subagents)\n=> closes with 'PROPOSE an architecture + confirm'" as WHO #FFE9C7
  rectangle "2b. Skills  (advertised; read on demand)" as SK #C8E6C9
  rectangle "2c. Planning  (if update_plan — strong nudge)" as PL #C8E6C9
  rectangle "2d. Verify Before You Send (REQUIRED)  [S3]\nMUST verify substantial/delivered answers;\nNEEDS-WORK => fix + re-verify; never ship a failed verify" as V #FFE9C7
  rectangle "3.  Tool Call Style" as TCS #C8E6C9
  rectangle "4.  Execution Bias  (act · continue-until-done · evidence)" as EB #C8E6C9
  rectangle "4c. Before You Finish — honesty  [S3]\nON BY DEFAULT (completeness_check): every part\naddressed + evidence-backed; NEVER fabricate" as H #FFE9C7
  rectangle "5.  Safety   ·   6. Workspace + User Folders\n7. Date/Time   ·   8. Project Context (AGENTS.md/MEMORY.md)   ·   9. Runtime" as REST #C8E6C9
}

I --> P
P --> ID
ID --> HB
HB --> CR
CR --> CH
CH --> L
L --> T
T --> WHO
WHO --> SK
SK --> PL
PL --> V
V --> TCS
TCS --> EB
EB --> H
H --> REST

note right of P
  This is "the SOUL" — what made OpenClaw's plain
  'main' feel rich. It lives in the BASE prompt, so
  EVERY agent + chat gets it (not per-agent).
end note

note right of WHO
  Returns nothing for a bare setup (no organs) =>
  no noise; auto-grows as memory/sub-agents enable.
end note

@enduml
